      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯，当然。所有细节都在我的掌握之中。\n订购餐点和饮品时已经考虑到来场人数、\n时段以及天气──",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fe5d9494b286019b9af9cbeb230627198f3cda1c4dff0ab7aef7fed51456574",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
