      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵，因为我希望大家都尽兴啊。\n不嫌弃的话，也欢迎你务必来参加。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fd0ce6a92fb32554aaea3ecc7ea9c60783d4e0772df4f24dd7bcc54aab68c46",
